Legal texts

The texts are official acts of the Democratic Republic of Timor-Leste, taken from the Jornal da Republica published
by the Ministry of Justice (https://www.mj.gov.tl/jornal/). Legislative and regulatory texts and judicial decisions
are not protected by copyright in Timor-Leste: Codigo do Direito de Autor e dos Direitos Conexos (Lei n.o 14/2022,
de 21 de dezembro), artigo 15.o, n.o 1, alinea e) ("Nao constituem objeto de protecao: [...] As decisoes judiciais e
os textos legislativos e regulamentares"). No terms of use were found on the Jornal da Republica's site (checked
2026-10-28 and 2026-11-26). When quoting, cite: "Jornal da Republica, Republica Democratica de Timor-Leste,
Ministerio da Justica" with the series, number and date of the issue (see the Published: and Source: trailers of
each commit).

